sequenceDiagram
    actor U as User
    participant UI as Angular Web UI
    participant EDGE as API Edge
    participant AUTHN as Authentication Adapter
    participant AUTHZ as Authorization Policy Service
    participant CIS as Cloud Identity Service
    participant PREPO as Permission Repository

    U->>UI: Enter credentials
    UI->>EDGE: Login request
    EDGE->>AUTHN: Authenticate
    AUTHN->>CIS: Validate credentials / token
    CIS-->>AUTHN: Identity result
    AUTHN-->>EDGE: Authenticated identity
    EDGE->>AUTHZ: Load function/hotel authorization context
    AUTHZ->>PREPO: Retrieve permissions
    PREPO-->>AUTHZ: Permissions
    AUTHZ-->>EDGE: Authorization context
    EDGE-->>UI: Login success with allowed functions/hotel scope